WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:01.928
You know that friend you keep meaning

00:00:01.940 --> 00:00:02.970
to have brunch with?

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:04.250
Pull up a chair.

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:06.108
Mommy and Daddy Break Club

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:08.010
is a morning for South Florida parents.

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:10.430
Come with someone, or come on your own.

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:12.230
Trade stories over brunch.

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:14.430
When the DJ puts a favorite record on,

00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:15.830
stay for one more song.

00:00:16.400 --> 00:00:17.590
We're planning two mornings a month.

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:19.368
Join the free priority list

00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:20.410
for one or two adults.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:22.508
When a date opens, we'll send

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:23.830
the venue and the ticket price.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:25.340
You choose your morning.
